# Weight profile nemotron-bolt-iq2: NVIDIA Nemotron 3.5 Bolt 74B-A9B as NVIDIA published it for 24 GB, the GGUF of
# revision 724e3fee of nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Bolt-74B-A9B-24GB-GGUF (22.0 GB: IQ2_XXS experts, NVFP4 Mamba2
# projections, Q8_0 head, attention and latent projections), read as stored and not re-hosted. Its config, tokenizer
# and chat template come from the BF16 repository (revision 153d4551); the GGUF is the registry entry's asset.
# Switch with ops/use-profile.sh nemotron-bolt-iq2.
QSE_NH_MODEL=nemotron-3.5-bolt-74b-a9b
QSE_NH_VARIANT=bolt-iq2
# the disk the profile takes: the GGUF (22.02, its asset) and the text files (0.02); the fetch checks both
QSE_WEIGHTS_GB=22.04
# the model's whole context (max_position_embeddings): its KV is 8,192 bytes a token (8 attention layers, 2 KV
# heads of 128), 2 GiB at 262,144
MAX_LEN=262144
# MemAvailable (GiB) a start needs: the weights (22.19 allocated, measured), the engine and its graphs, the
# allocator, the prefill workspace, three slots' KV, LiLiCorr (1.32 allocated, measured) and the 15 GiB floor
QSE_MEM_NEED_GIB=50
# the engine's limits. Ceiling: the weights (22.19) + the runtime (an estimate of 4 until measured) + the KV of
# three slots at 262,144 tokens (6) + LiLiCorr (1.32, its weights, rings and graph); peak: the ceiling + the
# prefill workspace (an estimate of 4)
MEM_CEILING_GIB=35
MEM_PEAK_GIB=39
# NVIDIA's LiLiCorr drafter (SPD-123): a draft head of the tree drafter beside the lookup, its NVFP4 checkpoint
# of revision 4c6a5613 of nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Bolt-74B-A9B-24GB-LiLiCorr, the registry entry's asset
QSE_NH_HEAD=lilicorr
QSE_NH_LILICORR=${HOME}/models/nemotron-3.5-bolt-lilicorr
. "${REPO}/ops/profiles/_nemotron.env"
# the weights' directory holds the BF16 repository's text files; the GGUF is NVIDIA's download beside it
QSE_WEIGHTS_HF=nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Bolt-74B-A9B-BF16
QSE_WEIGHTS_REVISION=153d4551268566bb7d57681ceded1289e6341fcd
QSE_WEIGHTS_FILES="config.json generation_config.json tokenizer.json tokenizer_config.json chat_template.jinja"
QSE_NH_GGUF=${HOME}/models/nemotron-3.5-bolt-74b-a9b-iq2-gguf/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Bolt-74B-A9B-24GB.gguf
# the GGUF and LiLiCorr: the registry entry's assets (models/nemotron-3.5-bolt-74b-a9b/model.yaml), fetched when missing
QSE_ASSETS="${QSE_NH_GGUF} ${QSE_NH_LILICORR}/model.safetensors"
QSE_PAGE_CACHE_DROP=${HOME}/models/nemotron-3.5-bolt-74b-a9b-iq2-gguf
# Bolt has no MTP head: LiLiCorr and the lookup draft, cut by StairCut (QSE_NH_HEAD, _nemotron.env)
